Primary keys are mapped with the `@Id` annotation, usually combined with `@GeneratedValue`.

```java
@Entity
public class User {
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    // Other fields
}
```

Generation strategies: `IDENTITY` (database auto-increment), `SEQUENCE` (database sequence), `TABLE` (separate table for ID generation), `AUTO` (the provider chooses).

